  "details": "Make an Udon graph with your windows system language set to Swedish and place in a float with a decimal, say \"0.3\".\n\nChange your system language to English and open the same graph and it will remove the comma and convert the float to \"3\". The change is permanent and does not revert if you change the system language back.",
